A '''human tribe''' lived on the [[planet]] [[Sorgan]]<ref name="Mandalorian4" /> by [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|4}}</ref> A peaceful tribe of [[krill farmer]]s, it consisted of men, women, and children living in a [[Unidentified village (Sorgan)|village]] of primitive structures, with limited amounts of [[droid]] technology and only a small amount of weapons for protection. The grandparents of [[Caben]], one of the farmers, helped seed the ponds with [[Krill (creature)|krill]], which took generations to come to fruition. The tribe showed some uniformity in the [[clothing]] worn by its members, which was predominantly dark [[Color|gray]] and teal in coloration.<ref name="Mandalorian4" />

